{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "b8aa25bf-9a5f-8030-9ffa-ba43e607ef98",
  "created_at": "2025-12-31T16:03:17-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Kevin M. Donovan",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Sandra Pimentel",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T16:01:25-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Sandra. Happy almost New Year, how can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T16:01:30-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, hello. Happy New Year. I am calling about animal control. I think I have the right office? Somebody told me to call here."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T16:01:38-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're close enough. We can take the report and get it to the right people. What's going on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T16:01:44-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "There is a coyote by the playground. I saw it today, this afternoon, maybe one hour ago. Third time this week I see it there, and nobody is doing anything."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T16:01:54-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, that's not great with kids around. Where's the playground, exactly?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T16:01:58-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is near 331 Malbone Road. In the North End. The coyote was on the grass just past the swings, by the fence."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T16:02:06-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 331 Malbone Road. Can you describe it for me? How big?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T16:02:10-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Medium size. Bigger than a fox, I think, but not like a big dog. Maybe like a, um, a German shepherd but thinner. Gray and brown, a little yellow on the legs. Long thin tail, down low."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T16:02:21-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That sounds like a coyote, all right. Did it act aggressive, or just wander around?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T16:02:26-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Just walking, looking around. But it was not afraid of me. I am at work, you know, the gas station store. Is slow right now, no customers, so I can call. Otherwise I cannot."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T16:02:37-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood, I appreciate you taking the time. I'll put this in as a sighting and send it over to animal control. Can I get a callback number in case they have questions?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T16:02:47-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. It is 401-555-0170. Ask for Kevin Donovan. Donovan, D-O-N-O-V-A-N."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T16:02:51-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, Kevin Donovan, 401-555-0170. In the meantime, keep kids and small pets away from that area, and don't approach it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T16:02:58-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I just want somebody to check. Every time I say, they say they will look, and then nothing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T16:03:04-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you. I'll make sure the note says it's been repeated this week. Anything else?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T16:03:10-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that is all. Thank you, Sandra."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T16:03:13-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Take care, and have a good night."
    }
  ],
